flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Consent{Synthetic or authorized sanitized evidence?}
    Consent -- No --> Stop[Do not upload; sanitize / obtain authorization]
    Consent -- Yes --> Intake[Enter incident metadata and upload/paste evidence]
    Intake --> Validate{Supported UTF-8 file and size?}
    Validate -- No --> Error[Show clear validation error]
    Error --> Intake
    Validate -- Yes --> Store[Assign evidence IDs and store locally in SQLite]
    Store --> Analyze[Extract timestamps, indicators, and rule matches]
    Analyze --> Inspect[Analyst inspects source excerpts, flags, and uncertainty]
    Inspect --> Draft[Generate evidence-linked draft report]
    Draft --> Edit[Edit sections and review references]
    Edit --> Decision{Human decision}
    Decision -- Needs work --> InReview[Save as In Review / revise]
    InReview --> Edit
    Decision -- Reject --> Rejected[Record Rejected]
    Decision -- Approve --> Approved[Record Approved by named reviewer]
    Rejected --> Export[Export with current status label]
    Approved --> Export
